# Romanian weekday, bare and with the enclitic definite article.  The
# articulated form (marțea) is the ordinary written shape in
# "marțea trecută/viitoare" (= last/next Tuesday).  Definite article of the
# days of the week per dexonline / DOOM.
# https://dexonline.ro/definitie/marți
marți
marti
marțea
martea
